      "sequence": 0,
      "normalized_content": "Do you know our city is famous for fashion? The past month saw a big fashion show in Shenzhen. People from over forty countries came to attend it. They enjoyed the colourful show and bought a lot of Chinese products. They all said that the show was amazing. It is a great chance for Chinese fashion trade to communicate with the world."
    },
