    },
    {
      "item_id": "3",
      "sequence": 3,
      "normalized_content": "W: What do you enjoy doing in your free time?\nM: I like going hiking.\nW: How often do you do it?\nM: Usually three times a month."
    },
    {
      "item_id": "4",
      "sequence": 4,
      "normalized_content": "Who is Mr White? (The woman's boss. / The woman's doctor / The woman's teacher.)"
