    },
    {
      "item_id": "6",
      "sequence": 6,
      "normalized_content": "M: Who is the man over there?\nW: He is my new English teacher, Mr. White.\nM: Where is he from?\nW: He is from Canada. He just moved here last week.\nM: Oh, I see."
    },
    {
      "item_id": "7",
      "sequence": 7,
      "normalized_content": "How does the man feel? (Worried. / Shocked. / Disappointed.)"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "8",
