      "normalized_content": "Why does the man feel so? (Because he broke a cup. / Because he lost his watch. / Because he failed an exam.)"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "9",
      "sequence": 9,
      "normalized_content": "W: You don't look well today.\nM: I'm quite worried.\nW: Oh, why?\nM: I have lost my watch. It is a birthday gift from my mother.\nW: Take it easy. Let me help you look for it.\nM: Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "item_id": "10",
      "sequence": 10,
      "normalized_content": "What was the dream about?"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "11",
