    },
    {
      "item_id": "13",
      "sequence": 13,
      "normalized_content": "Why can the managers communicate well?"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "14",
      "sequence": 14,
      "normalized_content": "One night, I had a dream. It was about a future working day. In the dream, I become a manager. At 7:00 a.m. A robot cooks breakfast for me. Then I go to work by car. The car drives by itself. In the afternoon, I have an online meeting with managers from foreign countries. We communicate well because AI translates different languages. After work, I put on my VR glasses to travel in space."
    },
    {
      "item_id": "15",
      "sequence": 15,
      "normalized_content": "I'm Peter. I visited Yangshuo last August. I went there to enjoy its great views. There were many exciting activities to choose from. First, I took a boat down the river. The water was green and clear. Next, I rode a bike in the countryside. The Blue Mountains looked cool. At the end of the day, I had fish for dinner. What an unforgettable trip!"
    }
